"""Public policy text. Owner must review against actual operations before live launch.
No invented LLC, registration, insurer, certification, or blanket liability waiver.
"""
import html
import os
from datetime import datetime, timezone

def policy(kind, site, support):
    email=html.escape(support);site=html.escape(site)
    owner=html.escape(os.getenv('CORNER_LEGAL_NAME','Corner Boxing'))
    common='<p>Effective November 13, 2026. Operated by '+owner+' in Ohio, United States. Contact: <a href="mailto:'+email+'">'+email+'</a>.</p>'
    texts={
    'terms':('Corner Terms of Service', '''
<h2>Who can use Corner</h2><p>Corner is intended for people age 13 and older in the United States. Users under 18 need permission from a parent or legal guardian. An adult parent or guardian must authorize and complete a minor’s subscription purchase. Do not create accounts for children under 13. Contact support if an underage account has been created. Guardian email approval records permission; it is not government identity verification.</p>
<h2>What Corner provides</h2><p>Free access includes the demo class, Learn, Train, profiles, gyms, stats, badges, Legends, and rankings. Pro adds full customized class generation. Account progress is based on recorded activity and does not certify skill, fitness, medical condition, or actual punches thrown. We may correct errors or fraudulent activity.</p>
<h2>Subscriptions</h2><p>Pro costs $9.99 each month or $99 each year, plus applicable taxes shown at checkout. There is no free trial. Your selected subscription renews automatically at the disclosed interval until canceled. You authorize the recurring charge when you accept checkout. Existing free promo access does not automatically become a paid subscription. Discounts are described at checkout and do not stack unless expressly stated.</p>
<h2>Canceling and payment failures</h2><p>Cancel through Corner → Billing → Manage billing, or contact support if you cannot access your account. Cancellation normally stops future renewal and leaves access through your paid period. After a failed renewal, existing paid subscribers receive a three-day access grace period while payment is retried. The first payment must succeed before paid access is granted. You can update payment details or cancel during retries. If you delete your account, access ends and future renewal is stopped. Refunds are handled under the Refund Policy; deletion does not itself request a refund.</p>
<h2>Acceptable use and community</h2><p>Do not harass, threaten, impersonate, post unlawful material, share someone else’s private information, exploit billing or progression, or upload material you do not have permission to use. You remain responsible for content you post. You allow Corner to store and display that content as needed to provide your chosen social features. Report abuse, privacy concerns, or copyright complaints to support, identifying the relevant account or content. We may remove content or restrict accounts for misuse.</p>
<h2>Availability and changes</h2><p>Class generation depends on service availability and queue capacity. We do not guarantee uninterrupted service or a specific generation time. We may make reasonable changes to the service. Material subscription changes will be communicated before they affect renewal, with an opportunity to cancel. Stat and cosmetic unlocks have no cash value.</p>
<h2>Exercise and your rights</h2><p>Read the Fitness Notice before training. Corner is not medical advice, a live coach, or an emergency service. Nothing in these Terms removes consumer rights or responsibilities that cannot lawfully be excluded. Contact support about service problems or billing errors so we can address them.</p>
'''),
    'privacy':('Corner Privacy Policy','''
<h2>Information we use</h2><p>We use your account email and authentication identifiers, profile and avatar choices, privacy settings, posts/comments, social connections, gym participation, workout settings, completion and heartbeat records, earned progress, subscription identifiers and status, promo records, policy acceptance, and email preferences. We process your birth date to determine an age group and store the group rather than the full birth date. Teen accounts also use a guardian email and approval record. Authentication providers may retain information under their own policies.</p>
<h2>Purposes and service providers</h2><p>We use this information to authenticate accounts, provide workouts/community features, calculate access and progress, process subscriptions, prevent abuse, respond to support, and deliver requested messages. Supabase provides account/data/storage services; Netlify and Render support hosting; Stripe processes billing; Brevo delivers email; Google may handle login or support email. Providers process information under their applicable terms. Corner does not receive or store full card numbers. Stripe receives payment, billing/address, and transaction information.</p>
<h2>Public and shared content</h2><p>Your username, selected profile/avatar information, rankings, and posts may be visible to others according to the feature and privacy setting. Gym content is shared with the relevant members. Private account settings do not promise anonymity in every feature, including rankings. Do not post sensitive personal details. Contact support about removal or abuse.</p>
<h2>Email and local storage</h2><p>Essential account/billing emails are separate from optional marketing and training reminders. Optional emails are off until an adult account opts in and can be stopped in Account → Email preferences or with the unsubscribe link. We store unsubscribe and delivery-suppression information to honor requests. Our email integration does not require open/click tracking. We use browser storage for login sessions, preferences, and workout continuity; authentication and payment providers may use their own cookies. We do not sell personal information or use this integration for targeted advertising.</p>
<h2>Retention and deletion</h2><p>Account data is retained while needed to operate your account. Use the account deletion control or contact support. Deletion stops future subscription renewal and removes account/community/workout data subject to necessary billing, fraud-prevention, consent, and legal records. Delivery records are normally removed after 90 days and successfully processed payment-event copies after 30 days. Provider records and backups may persist under their retention policies. Existing gym-message expiration is subject to the app’s cleanup process. We do not promise immediate removal from every backup or third-party financial record.</p>
<h2>Teen users and requests</h2><p>Corner is intended for ages 13+. Optional promotional emails are disabled for teen accounts. Parents/guardians can contact support to withdraw permission or request removal. If we learn we have collected information from a child under 13, we will address it under applicable requirements. Contact support for access, correction, deletion, privacy concerns, or other rights that may apply to you.</p>
<h2>Security and updates</h2><p>We use access controls and provider security features, but no system is completely secure. Do not share sign-in or guardian links. We will update this policy when practices change and provide notice where required.</p>
'''),
    'refunds':('Corner Cancellation and Refund Policy','''
<p>You may request a full refund of your first paid Corner subscription payment within seven days after that payment. This applies to the first monthly or annual purchase, not each renewal or a later resubscription. Use Corner → Billing → Request first-payment refund. For teen accounts, an authorized parent/guardian uses the emailed link.</p>
<p>An eligible automated refund cancels that subscription immediately and ends its paid access. Separate valid promo access and your Free account are preserved. Refund completion depends on the payment provider and your bank; we do not promise an exact posting date. We will help resolve failed or disputed refund requests.</p>
<p>Outside the first-purchase window, routine cancellation stops renewal without an automatic partial-period refund. Contact support about duplicate charges, unauthorized payments, outages, or other problems. We review exceptions and honor any remedies required by law. A payment already refunded or disputed requires support review.</p>
<p>Cancel renewal in Manage billing before the next charge. If cancellation controls fail, email support promptly. Deleting your account also stops renewal but does not automatically request a refund.</p>
'''),
    'fitness':('Corner Fitness Notice','''
<p>Corner supplies general exercise information and prerecorded/generated audio guidance. It is not medical advice, physical therapy, personalized medical clearance, or real-time supervision.</p>
<p>Use suitable equipment and a clear training area. Choose an appropriate pace, learn technique, and stop if you experience pain, dizziness, chest discomfort, unusual shortness of breath, or other concerning symptoms. Obtain qualified medical or coaching advice when needed. Contact emergency services for an emergency.</p>
<p>Boxing and exercise can cause injury. Audio instructions cannot observe or correct your form. Stats, levels, and estimated progress are app features, not proof of physical readiness. Young users should train with appropriate adult guidance and permission. Do not use Corner callouts as unsupervised sparring instructions.</p>
''')}
    if kind not in texts:
        return 'Policy not found','<p>Use the Terms, Privacy, Refunds, or Fitness links in Corner.</p>'
    title,body=texts[kind]
    return title,common+body+'<p><a href="'+site+'">Return to Corner</a></p>'
